Dissertation: An integrated document containing a formal specification of the proposed governance architecture; the verified proof portfolio; the simulation campaign with PAC guarantees; the sandbox calibration and Phase A/B analysis; and a critical discussion of the conditions under which the proofs remain valid outside the sandbox’s scale and duration. The dissertation defence is a live adversarial examination as described in Section 7.1.

